This is for the line where the statement "// @@@ position of x in array after insertion is greater than or equal to 0" is written. In the given code, the problem is to find the position of an element in an array after insertion of an element is done. For that, the index of the new element should be greater or equal to 0. So, the assertion is done using the index value of the newly added element (returned from `ArrayList.Add`).

